{%- comment -%}
  LUMORA SETTING-SUN WORDMARK  ·  lu-footer-wordmark.liquid  ·  v1.0
  Paste into: Footer group > Add section > Custom Liquid, AFTER the Footer section. On load it moves
  itself inside the footer, above the copyright row (if the footer has one), so the giant gradient
  "lumora" sets behind a Honey horizon line between the menus and the small print. It sinks 8% as the
  page ends (scroll-linked, about 20 lines below) and stays still under reduced motion. Decorative only:
  aria-hidden, because the footer logo already names the brand. The one sanctioned gradient on a word.
{%- endcomment -%}
